{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "grp_root",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "📋 Discussion Workspace",
      "x": -106,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_sidenote",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**📌 System Setup**\n\n### Active UI development\nAcknowledge active engineering and design efforts to improve visual mapping quality.\n\n### Visual nodes shape\nUser observed the default visual shape representation (circular/node-based) of the interface.",
      "x": -402,
      "y": -229,
      "width": 402,
      "height": 197
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_meeting_context",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**📋 Human Conversation Mapping**\n\n### Human-to-human focus\nTransitioned to mapping real-time human discussions rather than AI-direct interactions.",
      "x": -323,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 201
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_realtime_value",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⚡ Real-time Synthesis**\n\n### Value of immediacy\nAcknowledge the immediate value of real-time AI summarization during active discussion.",
      "x": -878,
      "y": 704,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 201
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_roles",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**📌 Team Roles**\n\n### Core technical ownership\nAcknowledged Minsung as the primary technical anchor who commands overall product knowledge.\n\n### Discord active presence\nNoted Minsung's highly active and responsive presence on Discord for communication.",
      "x": 16,
      "y": -229,
      "width": 402,
      "height": 197
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_market_position",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**📋 Market & Cost Value**\n\n### Disruptive pricing model\nDiscussion shifted to the high utility of offering a comprehensive AI service for free.",
      "x": 572,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 221
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_competitor_landscape",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**🔍 Alternative Tools**\n\n### Alternative exploration\nNoted mentions of custom API integration and alternative agents (e.g., Gobi Agent).",
      "x": -401,
      "y": 704,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 197
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_use_cases",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⚡ AI Use Cases**\n\n### Automated website building\nExplored specific capabilities of agent alternatives, such as automated homepage creation.",
      "x": -11,
      "y": 1439,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 197
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_pkm_sharing",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**💡 PKM & Sharing Motivation**\n\n### Need to share personal knowledge\nStrong alignment on the user desire to easily share curated PKM spaces with others.\n\n### Active repository usage\nSpeaker noted their own active history of uploading recent work directly onto the platform.",
      "x": 518,
      "y": 704,
      "width": 402,
      "height": 197
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_gobi_ecosystem",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**🔍 Gobi Platform**\n\n### Gobi personal site dependency\nHighlighted constant reliance on Gobi as the central repository for personal web content.\n\n### Git-based workflow constraint\nNoted tension where users primarily view or manage assets directly through Git.",
      "x": 953,
      "y": 704,
      "width": 402,
      "height": 197
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_language_localization",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**📌 Language Preferences**\n\n### Language localization tension\nUser raised a question about the map layout generating primary summaries in English.",
      "x": 434,
      "y": -253,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 221
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_meeting_navigation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⚡ Active Meeting Navigation**\n\n### In-meeting historical reference\nValue of reviewing one's own spoken contributions and flow in real-time during a meeting.",
      "x": -639,
      "y": 704,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 221
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_predictive_guidance",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**💡 Predictive Conversation Guidance**\n\n### Predictive agenda prompts\nIntended feature to predict and suggest optimal next discussion points based on the active agenda.",
      "x": -158,
      "y": 704,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 239
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_product_identity",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**📋 Product Identity Evolution**\n\n### Meeting assistant development\nActive engineering and design effort dedicated to realizing the interactive meeting assistant vision.",
      "x": 294,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 212,
      "height": 239
    },
    {
      "id": "grp_product_differentiation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**⚖️ Product Comparison**\n\n### Minimix differentiation\nA key question was raised comparing the current system with Jinyoung's 'Minimix' product.\n\n### Domain focus vs General utility\nThis platform optimizes specifically for meetings, whereas other tools target general data workflows.\n\n### Activation barrier tension\nTension identified: If users already have general-purpose tools always active, there is friction in launching a separate meeting-only tool.\n\n### Voice interaction paradigm\nUsing voice as the primary native input medium lowers friction and defines the core differentiation.\n\n### Functional convergence\nAcknowledged that core underlying AI capabilities and features tend to overlap and converge across products.",
      "x": 88,
      "y": 704,
      "width": 402,
      "height": 569
    }
  ],
